          %h2#references References
          %p Textbook account:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Francis+Borceux"}> Francis Borceux
              , Section 2.1 in Vol. 1:
              %em Basic Category Theory
              of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Handbook+of+Categorical+Algebra"} Handbook of Categorical Algebra
              %strong 50
              Cambridge University Press (1994) (
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511525858"}> doi:10.1017/CBO9780511525858
              )
          %p Categories with one object and binary products are studied in:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Aaron Gray and Keith Pardue,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Products in a Category with One Object
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1604.03999"} arXiv:1604.03999
                (2016).
            %li
